[Music]  hello I'm Francisca and making a fitting  place for birds with plastic cutlery is  quite easy I will show you how you can  do it yourself you need a plate and a  bowl of hot plastics such as melamine a  20 centimeter long threaded rod which  you can get from a DIY shop for washes  for nook and a drill drill a hole in the  center of the bowl press only lies you  go to drill and take great care because  the plastic can split now do the same  with a plate getting just as much can  [Music]  take the threaded rod and push it  through the hole in the bowl fix the rod  from above and below with a washer and  nut you can also use classic washers  which are especially suitable for  melamine  [Music]  and this is how the whole thing looks  now take a washer and nut and screw it  to the top end of the rod put the plate  upside down on top of it fix it with  another nut and washer and your bird  feeder is ready if you'd prefer to hang  it up and not stand it screw another nut  onto the upper part of the threaded rod  and fit the car to it now all you need  is bird food and the birds can come and  if you find the roof top boring you can  paint it with colorful strips or dots  just remember to use waterproof paint

